  "title": "wsutil: Compare profile path prefix with canonical dir sep",
  "description": "Ensure that get_profiles_dir_with_trailing_sep uses the canonical\ndirectory separator. This is most important on MSYS2 when running\ntests, where their patched version of CPython prefers the Unix\ndirectory separator.\n\nWe might want to ensure that our cached filesystem paths are always\nabsolutely, and possibly ensure that they are canonicalized.\n\nFollowup to c149b9f36264003dcb4ac664de64cec476136d14 needed for tests\non MSYS2.",
